Self-contained documentation assets
====================================

These files are exact snapshots of small development-tree inputs referenced by
Sphinx literal-includes or download links. Keeping the copies below docs/
allows NCAR/CheMPAS-A-Docs to build independently of the development
repository. They do not expand the supported contents of the public CheMPAS-A
MVP source release.

Source mapping:

* tutorial/abba_box.py <- scripts/musica_python/abba_box.py
* tutorial/abba.yaml <- micm_configs/abba.yaml

The files use the project license supplied with the source and documentation
repositories.
